---
<div class="my-12 p-8 sm:p-12 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0B1120] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 shadow-sm relative flex flex-col items-center">
  <div class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-navy-400 uppercase mb-12 text-center">The Anatomy of an FCNR Outflow</div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-2xl flex flex-col gap-6 relative">
    
    {/* Connection line behind the blocks */}
    <div class="absolute left-8 sm:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-slate-200 dark:bg-navy-700 sm:-translate-x-1/2 z-0"></div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center w-full gap-6 relative z-10 p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex-none w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white text-2xl sm:text-3xl">1</div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase mb-2">Gross Mobilisation</div>
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The headline number (e.g., $52.3 billion). Includes brand new dollars and existing dollars rebooked into the new scheme.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center w-full gap-6 relative z-10 p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-2xl shadow-sm sm:w-[92%] mx-auto">
      <div class="flex-none w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">2</div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400 uppercase mb-2">Outstanding Stock</div>
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The actual net increase in India's total FCNR liabilities. Always smaller than gross mobilisation.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center w-full gap-6 relative z-10 p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-2xl shadow-sm sm:w-[84%] mx-auto">
      <div class="flex-none w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">3</div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400 uppercase mb-2">Maturing Principal</div>
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The amount falling due in a specific time window (e.g., 2029–2031). It is a timeline, not a single lump sum.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center w-full gap-6 relative z-10 p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border-2 border-emerald-500/50 dark:border-emerald-500/50 rounded-2xl shadow-md sm:w-[76%] mx-auto mt-4 transform hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform">
      <div class="flex-none w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">4</div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-wide text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase mb-2">Actual Outflow</div>
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-medium">Maturing Principal &times; (1 &minus; Rollover Rate). This is the only number that actually leaves the system.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 text-center max-w-xl">
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 italic">"The first analytical mistake is to take the $52.3 billion mobilisation figure and imagine a giant bill waiting for India in 2029."</p>
  </div>
</div>
